30,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Our developers are busy until the third quarter, and the coordination group is understaffed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, that's worrying. Also, network coverage at customer plants is very unreliable, and visitor approval is slow.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,George,,"The capital budget is frozen, but we have some room in the software allowance.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"It seems tools requiring daily entry from everyone usually fail, while narrow tools survive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Midori,,"We are losing an hour daily to copying records, and misrouted deliveries are happening due to duplicate addresses.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, does the software allowance cover new licenses or just renewals?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, does that mean we should avoid tools that require broad participation?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,George,,"It's for recurring costs, but the capital line is definitely closed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, @Jonathan. Broad tools seem to be a waste of resources.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@George, would a tool to fix the address issues fit in that software allowance?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
